Package: citos-sources
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CybroidOS maintainers <citos@cybroid.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/cybroidinstitute/cit-os
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: debian-archive-keyring
Description: CybroidOS package sources (citos.cybroid.com)
 Points apt at citos.cybroid.com, which serves Debian 13's archive (and its
 security updates) under the CybroidOS name. Packages are still Debian's and
 checked against Debian's signing keys. Debian's own source entries are set
 aside, not deleted, and come back if this package is removed.
